# Substrates

Template and section marketplace. TanStack Start (Nitro SSR) on **Heroku** (`node-server`), Firebase Auth + Firestore, Lemon Squeezy billing, catalog MCP at `/mcp`.

Read before coding: `AGENTS.md`, `PRODUCT.md`, `docs/PROGRESS.md`, then the doc the prompt names (`docs/SPEC.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`).

## Hard rules

- Single catalog source: `src/lib/catalog.json`. Do not duplicate product data.
- Imported page markup stays in route files with separate source CSS. Do not reformat or "clean up" captured markup unless the prompt says so.
- One `AccountProvider` listener. Server functions require a Firebase ID token.
- Lemon Squeezy purchases are written only by the webhook through the Admin SDK. Firestore rules deny client writes to `purchases`.
- Never commit `.env`, service-account JSON, Lemon Squeezy keys, or private keys. Never print secret values; report variable names only.
- `Startup/`, `.site-import/`, `supabase/`, `.output/` are out of scope and gitignored. Read from `Startup/` only when a prompt tells you to.
- "Lovable" as an assistant copy target (Copy for Lovable) is product content. Lovable as a platform dependency is being removed.

## Commands

- `npm run verify`, `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build`. Add `npm run typecheck` once prompt P05 lands.
- Dev server: do not start it from the agent. Ask the user to run `npm run dev` (port 8080).
